  "notes": "{育|そだ}つ is an intransitive godan verb meaning to grow up or develop.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{自動詞|じどうし}→自動詞：10977_jidoushi⟧ (intransitive)\n- Pair: ⟦{育|そだ}てる→育てる：01235_sodateru⟧ (transitive, to raise)\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- X⟦で→で：00502_de⟧{育|そだ}つ: to grow up in X\n- ⟦{田舎|いなか}→田舎：01320_inaka⟧⟦で→で：00502_de⟧{育|そだ}った: grew up in the countryside\n- ⟦すくすく→すくすく：19420_sukusuku⟧と{育|そだ}つ: to grow vigorously\n- ⟦{大|おお}きく→大きい：00335_ookii⟧{育|そだ}つ: to grow large\n\nSUBJECTS:\n- People: ⟦{子供|こども}→子供：00554_kodomo⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{育|そだ}つ (child grows up)\n- Plants: ⟦{野菜|やさい}→野菜：02265_yasai⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{育|そだ}つ (vegetables grow)\n- Abstract: ⟦{才能|さいのう}→才能：02772_sainou⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{育|そだ}つ (talent develops)\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦{育|そだ}てる→育てる：01235_sodateru⟧: to raise (transitive)\n- ⟦{育児|いくじ}→育児：03998_ikuji⟧: childcare\n- ⟦{成長|せいちょう}→成長：03290_seichou⟧: growth",
